WEBVTT

00:00:03.690 --> 00:00:08.070
We're on our school field trip!

00:00:09.070 --> 00:00:12.160
Last time, when we were in Kyoto, I drew a really bad fortune!

00:00:12.160 --> 00:00:17.410
I was ultra unhappy!

00:00:18.750 --> 00:00:23.190
Then Akaoni showed up, and we were in a lot of trouble!

00:00:23.540 --> 00:00:29.280
But in the end, we got to meet a maiko, so everything ended up ultra happy!

00:00:31.460 --> 00:00:33.830
Alright! We're finally in Osaka!

00:00:38.140 --> 00:00:41.540
All that tasty okonomiyaki, pork skewers, tofu udon and takoyaki...

00:00:41.540 --> 00:00:43.280
We've gotta try them all!

00:00:43.280 --> 00:00:47.800
I spent the morning working out, and I barely had any breakfast to get myself ready!

00:00:47.800 --> 00:00:49.210
You're sure fired up!

00:00:49.450 --> 00:00:52.880
I've never eaten takoyaki before, so I'm rather looking forward to it.

00:00:52.880 --> 00:00:55.090
You've never eaten takoyaki?!

00:00:55.090 --> 00:00:58.520
It's so good, the flavor will blow you away!

00:00:59.460 --> 00:01:02.120
Takoyaki just explodes with flavor!

00:01:02.120 --> 00:01:03.230
Explode...?

00:01:03.230 --> 00:01:06.880
Wasn't that saying meant to be about art?

00:01:06.880 --> 00:01:08.560
Uh, oops?

00:01:12.870 --> 00:01:14.440
Smile! Smile! Smile! Smile!

00:01:14.440 --> 00:01:16.280
Smile Precure!

00:01:16.580 --> 00:01:17.180
Let's go!

00:01:17.180 --> 00:01:18.710
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:01:18.710 --> 00:01:19.850
All together!

00:01:20.080 --> 00:01:21.450
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:01:21.450 --> 00:01:23.650
Jump to tomorrow!

00:01:23.820 --> 00:01:26.320
Smile Precure!

00:01:28.190 --> 00:01:31.160
Smile! Smile! Smile Precure!

00:01:31.430 --> 00:01:36.600
A smile, shining like the sun.

00:01:36.960 --> 00:01:41.800
We all carry an undying sparkle.

00:01:42.540 --> 00:01:47.740
Keep going with all you've got, girls!

00:01:48.110 --> 00:01:52.680
Those beads of sweat are diamonds.

00:01:52.080 --> 00:01:52.650
So bright!

00:01:52.680 --> 00:01:57.850
The future that you'll shine the way to

00:01:58.220 --> 00:02:04.290
When you five lights seize the will to win.

00:02:02.260 --> 00:02:04.790
Happy! Sunny! Peace! March! Beauty!

00:02:05.330 --> 00:02:05.960
Let's go!

00:02:05.960 --> 00:02:08.660
(Smile! Smile!) The power of a smile

00:02:08.660 --> 00:02:11.600
(Smile! Smile!) Joins us all together.

00:02:11.930 --> 00:02:16.400
We'll never let a friend cry!

00:02:15.770 --> 00:02:16.970
Girls! Let's go!

00:02:17.040 --> 00:02:18.640
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:02:18.640 --> 00:02:19.770
Everybody!

00:02:19.810 --> 00:02:21.440
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:02:21.440 --> 00:02:23.980
Fly to the future!

00:02:24.310 --> 00:02:27.480
Sparkle! Smile Precure!

00:02:28.250 --> 00:02:29.650
Smile! Smile! Smile! Smile!

00:02:29.650 --> 00:02:31.950
Smile Precure!

00:02:38.320 --> 00:02:41.720
Today you'll be splitting up into groups to travel the city as you see fit.

00:02:41.720 --> 00:02:47.330
However, you are middle school students and I expect you to keep to your schedules.

00:02:47.330 --> 00:02:48.510
Yes, ma'am!

00:02:48.510 --> 00:02:51.410
That'll be no problem! I mean, we're Precures!

00:02:51.410 --> 00:02:53.210
Our teamwork's perfect!

00:02:53.210 --> 00:02:57.250
We've got a native Osakan with us too, so we'll be fine!

00:02:57.580 --> 00:02:58.670
Leave it ta me!

00:02:58.670 --> 00:03:01.520
I'll make sure ya see everything Osaka has to offer!

00:03:01.890 --> 00:03:04.430
Then we can all share Reika's first takoyaki experience!

00:03:05.510 --> 00:03:07.390
I can't wait!

00:03:07.390 --> 00:03:09.930
Shall we check our schedule, then?

00:03:10.200 --> 00:03:14.400
Osaka Castle, then Nakanoshima, the Tennouji Zoo...

00:03:14.400 --> 00:03:17.870
Oh my, if we don't hurry we won't have time to climb the Tsuutenkaku Tower!

00:03:18.070 --> 00:03:19.520
We'd better hurry!

00:03:21.080 --> 00:03:23.990
Osaka Castle sure is huge...

00:03:23.990 --> 00:03:30.290
Osaka Castle was built in 1583, by Toyotomi Hideyoshi.

00:03:30.290 --> 00:03:35.220
It was a very expensive and lavishly furnished building.

00:03:35.240 --> 00:03:38.530
However, during the Siege of Osaka in 1615...

00:03:38.530 --> 00:03:40.110
Miyuki, Miyuki!

00:03:40.110 --> 00:03:40.930
Yeah?

00:03:41.110 --> 00:03:44.230
If we're on a trip-kuru, I want to look my best-kuru!

00:03:45.610 --> 00:03:47.530
Please-kuru?

00:03:47.790 --> 00:03:52.910
The current castle tower is the third iteration, having last been restored in 1928.

00:03:52.910 --> 00:03:55.150
Ya sure know your stuff, Reika.

00:03:55.150 --> 00:03:56.490
Doesn't she, Miyuki?

00:03:58.780 --> 00:04:00.440
Huh?

00:04:00.440 --> 00:04:01.820
Wha-?! Huh?!

00:04:02.280 --> 00:04:04.150
Where'd they go?

00:04:05.610 --> 00:04:07.170
Kuru!

00:04:07.290 --> 00:04:09.820
Am I cute-kuru?

00:04:10.430 --> 00:04:12.760
Hey, look, everyone-kuru!

00:04:13.590 --> 00:04:15.490
Where did they go-kuru?!

00:04:17.690 --> 00:04:18.810
They're gone...

00:04:18.810 --> 00:04:20.220
Don't tell me...

00:04:21.710 --> 00:04:25.170
We're lost?!

00:04:37.450 --> 00:04:39.590
I'm sure I left them here somewhere...

00:04:39.590 --> 00:04:40.950
Ah, there they are!

00:04:40.950 --> 00:04:42.790
It's snack time-da wasa!

00:04:54.230 --> 00:04:56.010
They're gone! They're gone!

00:04:56.010 --> 00:05:00.530
I'd been saving those sweets, too-da wasa!

00:05:01.810 --> 00:05:05.410
We've come to this store in Osaka, which sells a very special kind of sweet.

00:05:05.410 --> 00:05:06.750
What? Sweets?

00:05:06.750 --> 00:05:11.720
This is our store's most notorious confectionery, the nattou gyouza flavor sweet!

00:05:15.670 --> 00:05:17.990
Wow, you really can taste the pork and the beans!

00:05:18.800 --> 00:05:23.700
Pork and soybean sweets? I have to try those-da wasa!

00:05:24.020 --> 00:05:26.870
I'm off... to Osaka-da wasa!

00:05:28.580 --> 00:05:31.220
Man, where'd they go off to...?

00:05:31.220 --> 00:05:33.800
Maybe they already traveled back down the tower?

00:05:34.680 --> 00:05:37.310
Geez! Let's go check...

00:05:38.980 --> 00:05:43.050
Miyuki! If you kept up with them, this wouldn't have happened-kuru!

00:05:43.050 --> 00:05:45.550
Well if you hadn't wanted to look pretty all of a sudden!

00:05:45.920 --> 00:05:47.500
That's totally irrelevant-kuru!

00:05:47.500 --> 00:05:49.090
No it's not!

00:05:49.090 --> 00:05:51.760
Now what're we gonna do?!

00:05:50.370 --> 00:05:51.760
Don't get all worked up.

00:05:51.760 --> 00:05:53.320
I'm sure we'll find them soon.

00:05:53.330 --> 00:05:56.060
Where did you girls come from?

00:05:57.080 --> 00:05:58.770
Are ya on a field trip?

00:05:59.660 --> 00:06:01.780
Oh, aren't ya adorable!

00:06:01.780 --> 00:06:03.470
Look at their cute little dumpling faces!

00:06:03.470 --> 00:06:04.940
This castle's really somethin', huh?

00:06:04.950 --> 00:06:06.100
You enjoy yourselves, okay?

00:06:06.100 --> 00:06:08.340
Here, have some sweeties for your trip.

00:06:09.100 --> 00:06:10.310
They're really good!

00:06:12.580 --> 00:06:14.540
Osaka's a good place!

00:06:14.540 --> 00:06:16.550
You have fun now!

00:06:17.980 --> 00:06:20.710
The hero, Yayoi, obtained [Sweet]!

00:06:20.710 --> 00:06:21.490
...What?

00:06:21.950 --> 00:06:24.160
It's like a role-playing game!

00:06:24.660 --> 00:06:27.400
We get items and information off the townsfolk,

00:06:27.400 --> 00:06:29.360
and head on an adventure with map in hand!

00:06:30.100 --> 00:06:35.540
Then the brave heroes rescue the lost princesses!

00:06:35.540 --> 00:06:36.510
What...?

00:06:38.630 --> 00:06:40.170
Guess they ain't here.

00:06:40.440 --> 00:06:41.970
Well, not much we can do.

00:06:41.970 --> 00:06:43.980
I'm sure we'll bump into them soon.

00:06:45.330 --> 00:06:46.710
You're awfully calm, ain'tcha?

00:06:46.710 --> 00:06:51.020
I have five siblings, remember?. I'm used to dealing with these kinds of things!

00:06:51.350 --> 00:06:54.220
We've just gotta keep on keeping on!

00:06:54.500 --> 00:06:58.460
I'm sure Miyuki-san and Yayoi will keep to the schedule.

00:06:59.110 --> 00:07:01.340
We've just got to keep moving forward!

00:07:01.340 --> 00:07:02.410
Sounds good.

00:07:03.690 --> 00:07:05.960
I'm starving, though...

00:07:05.960 --> 00:07:07.330
I know the feeling.

00:07:07.330 --> 00:07:09.000
Say cheese!

00:07:11.200 --> 00:07:12.790
Whoa!

00:07:12.790 --> 00:07:15.730
We can see all of Osaka from here!

00:07:16.610 --> 00:07:18.260
So, let's see...

00:07:18.260 --> 00:07:21.040
Next stop is this Nakanoshima place.

00:07:21.040 --> 00:07:22.980
Are the others there-kuru?

00:07:24.580 --> 00:07:26.540
I don't know how we get there, though...

00:07:26.540 --> 00:07:28.790
If it isn't you girls again!

00:07:28.790 --> 00:07:30.260
What a coincidence!

00:07:31.020 --> 00:07:32.290
It's those ladies...

00:07:32.290 --> 00:07:33.730
that gave us the sweets!

00:07:38.710 --> 00:07:40.400
That was delicious!

00:07:40.730 --> 00:07:43.240
Nice broth, isn't it?

00:07:43.250 --> 00:07:45.240
And only 6,300,000 yen!

00:07:46.750 --> 00:07:49.440
I wasn't bein' serious, it's just a joke!

00:07:49.440 --> 00:07:53.750
If you're heading to Nakanoshima, though, you should take the boat.

00:07:53.750 --> 00:07:54.900
The boat?

00:07:57.650 --> 00:08:00.310
Where on Earth have they gotten to...?

00:08:02.020 --> 00:08:02.990
Huh?

00:08:04.360 --> 00:08:07.900
Oh man, that tofu udon looks delicious!

00:08:07.900 --> 00:08:11.930
Hey, you've got the same uniforms as those other girls!

00:08:13.770 --> 00:08:17.400
U-Um, we're trying to find our friends...

00:08:17.400 --> 00:08:18.370
I don't suppose...

00:08:19.110 --> 00:08:21.410
Are you after a girl like this?

00:08:23.810 --> 00:08:24.870
Hey, it's Miyuki!

00:08:24.870 --> 00:08:26.780
They said they were going to Nakanoshima.

00:08:26.780 --> 00:08:30.450
They are keeping to the schedule, after all. We'd better go.

00:08:31.100 --> 00:08:32.560
Thanks!

00:08:35.710 --> 00:08:37.660
M-My tofu udon...

00:08:37.820 --> 00:08:42.030
Oh, right! Those girls already left on the boat!

00:08:42.030 --> 00:08:43.980
They sure were in a hurry...

00:08:50.770 --> 00:08:53.350
Are you on a field trip?

00:08:53.350 --> 00:08:54.640
We are.

00:08:54.640 --> 00:08:56.880
And enjoying it too, it seems!

00:08:57.370 --> 00:08:58.810
Would you like some sweets?

00:08:58.810 --> 00:08:59.750
Here, take them.

00:08:59.750 --> 00:09:01.840
Thank you very much!

00:09:01.840 --> 00:09:03.880
Get new items and power up!

00:09:05.880 --> 00:09:07.350
They're delicious-kuru!

00:09:07.680 --> 00:09:10.520
Osaka's such a lovely place.

00:09:11.830 --> 00:09:15.590
Why can't we just look around normally?!

00:09:15.590 --> 00:09:17.390
We've got to keep to the schedule...!

00:09:17.390 --> 00:09:19.200
I'm starving...

00:09:20.650 --> 00:09:23.010
Miyuki...

00:09:23.010 --> 00:09:25.140
Yayoi-chan...

00:09:25.480 --> 00:09:28.410
Where'd you go...?

00:09:28.910 --> 00:09:31.520
Mayu! Kiyomi, Hiroko!

00:09:31.520 --> 00:09:32.550
Oh, Akane!

00:09:33.550 --> 00:09:36.120
Have you seen Miyuki-san and Yayoi-san anywhere?

00:09:36.300 --> 00:09:37.450
Yeah, we just bumped into them.

00:09:37.450 --> 00:09:39.550
They were looking for you.

00:09:39.550 --> 00:09:41.510
Seriously? Where'd they go?!

00:09:41.510 --> 00:09:43.670
They said they were going to the zoo.

00:09:47.350 --> 00:09:49.560
I'm so hungry...

00:09:49.560 --> 00:09:51.340
Come again!

00:09:51.660 --> 00:09:54.030
I'm totally stuffed!

00:09:54.030 --> 00:09:56.230
It was so good-kuru!

00:09:56.230 --> 00:09:58.370
Akane-chan's okonomiyaki is really good...

00:09:58.370 --> 00:10:01.980
But eating it here makes it so much better!

00:10:02.670 --> 00:10:05.780
I wanna try that too-kuru!

00:10:06.250 --> 00:10:08.750
Come get some fresh takoyaki!

00:10:09.190 --> 00:10:10.680
Takoyaki...

00:10:10.680 --> 00:10:13.340
I wanna try some!

00:10:10.680 --> 00:10:13.340
{I wanna try some-kuru!} {- so you can find it easily :P}

00:10:14.140 --> 00:10:18.070
<i>I've never eaten takoyaki before, so I'm rather looking forward to it.</i>

00:10:18.070 --> 00:10:21.330
<i>Then we can all share Reika's first takoyaki experience!</i>

00:10:23.020 --> 00:10:24.640
We can come back some other time.

00:10:24.640 --> 00:10:25.530
But why-kuru?

00:10:25.900 --> 00:10:27.950
It's better to enjoy it when we're done.

00:10:27.950 --> 00:10:30.390
Anyway, let's get to the zoo and meet the others!

00:10:30.390 --> 00:10:34.150
Oh my! To think we'd run into ya again!

00:10:34.150 --> 00:10:35.090
They're...

00:10:35.090 --> 00:10:37.140
those nice ladies from before!

00:10:37.640 --> 00:10:40.510
Those friends of yours are trying to find ya, ya know.

00:10:41.470 --> 00:10:44.740
Really?! We'd better get to the zoo!

00:10:44.740 --> 00:10:48.270
Oh, we're heading that way too! We'll show ya the way!

00:10:48.270 --> 00:10:48.960
But...

00:10:49.110 --> 00:10:50.510
Oh, it's alright!

00:10:50.510 --> 00:10:52.180
Really!

00:10:53.620 --> 00:10:54.790
Okay then!

00:11:03.550 --> 00:11:07.380
Oh, that smells good... I'm so hungry...

00:11:07.380 --> 00:11:09.910
Come on, Nao!

00:11:13.820 --> 00:11:15.650
Of course...

00:11:16.030 --> 00:11:18.940
Just follow the {yellow brick }road here, and the zoo will be right ahead of ya.

00:11:18.940 --> 00:11:24.230
Oh right, we bought some of those nattou gyouza sweets earlier. Here, take some.

00:11:24.230 --> 00:11:26.060
Nattou and...

00:11:26.060 --> 00:11:27.440
Gyouza...?

00:11:31.340 --> 00:11:32.900
Thank you very much!

00:11:33.180 --> 00:11:34.860
You're welcome!

00:11:34.860 --> 00:11:36.870
Thank you!

00:11:37.730 --> 00:11:40.170
What's that over there-kuru?

00:11:40.510 --> 00:11:41.880
Tsuutenkaku Tower!

00:11:41.880 --> 00:11:47.350
Hey, Miyuki-chan! Maybe if we scale the summit, we might be able to see the princesses!

00:11:47.350 --> 00:11:48.620
Good idea!

00:11:55.450 --> 00:11:58.970
Just hang in there! It won't be far now...

00:12:09.070 --> 00:12:11.540
Finally, I'm here in Osaka-da wasa!

00:12:11.940 --> 00:12:14.510
Now, where are these nattou gyouza sweets-da wasa?!

00:12:21.480 --> 00:12:22.680
Sunny!

00:12:28.370 --> 00:12:29.550
Candy!

00:12:31.520 --> 00:12:33.900
Thank you very much! Come again!

00:12:35.310 --> 00:12:38.360
I'll take all the nattou gyouza sweets you have-da wasa!

00:12:38.360 --> 00:12:40.640
I'm terribly sorry, but we just sold out.

00:12:41.520 --> 00:12:43.710
That TV advertisement really brought in the customers...

00:12:43.710 --> 00:12:45.400
I'm very sorry.

00:12:47.180 --> 00:12:51.110
Do you realize how much I was looking forward to them-da wasa?!

00:12:51.110 --> 00:12:57.750
Fine then! I'll take the humans' Bad Energy instead of your stupid sweets-da wasa!

00:12:57.750 --> 00:12:58.660
What...?

00:13:00.910 --> 00:13:03.260
The Precure are here in Osaka-da wasa?

00:13:04.270 --> 00:13:05.900
Oh, that's just perfect-da wasa!

00:13:06.430 --> 00:13:09.750
This world will be stained with the worst possible conclusion...

00:13:09.750 --> 00:13:12.700
...a Bad End-da wasa!

00:13:12.700 --> 00:13:17.000
The blank slate of your future will be clouded in darkness-da wasa!

00:13:22.240 --> 00:13:23.180
Is this?!

00:13:25.910 --> 00:13:29.450
I'm not giving anyone... any of my sweets...

00:13:31.260 --> 00:13:34.250
The Bad Energy we gather from the humans...

00:13:34.250 --> 00:13:39.160
will resurrect the Emperor of Darkness, Pierrot-sama, da wasa!

00:13:42.810 --> 00:13:45.770
Come forth, Akanbe!

00:13:48.070 --> 00:13:50.570
Akanbe!

00:13:55.870 --> 00:13:58.850
Akanbe?!

00:14:00.680 --> 00:14:02.090
Akanbe!

00:14:02.910 --> 00:14:04.180
Whoa!

00:14:05.050 --> 00:14:06.910
What's with these sweets?

00:14:08.780 --> 00:14:10.060
Pork and soybeans?!

00:14:10.560 --> 00:14:11.260
Miyuki!

00:14:13.730 --> 00:14:15.210
Miyuki, you've got to transform-kuru!

00:14:15.210 --> 00:14:15.930
Right!

00:14:16.240 --> 00:14:17.710
Come on, let's transform!

00:14:17.710 --> 00:14:18.640
Okay!

00:14:22.310 --> 00:14:23.610
Ready?

00:14:23.840 --> 00:14:26.940
Precure, Smile Charge!

00:14:26.940 --> 00:14:28.190
Go!

00:14:28.880 --> 00:14:30.300
Go, go!

00:14:30.680 --> 00:14:32.330
Let's go!

00:15:32.280 --> 00:15:35.130
The light of the future, shining bright!

00:15:36.690 --> 00:15:38.350
Cure Happy!

00:15:40.620 --> 00:15:42.390
Dazzling sun!

00:15:42.390 --> 00:15:44.280
Hot-blooded power!

00:15:45.150 --> 00:15:46.770
Cure Sunny!

00:15:49.100 --> 00:15:52.170
Rock, paper, scissors! Sparkling bright...

00:15:53.440 --> 00:15:55.290
Cure Peace!

00:15:56.730 --> 00:16:00.420
Laying down the gauntlet, with courage blazing!

00:16:01.560 --> 00:16:03.500
Cure March!

00:16:05.690 --> 00:16:09.250
A gentle heart as pure as the driven snow...

00:16:10.550 --> 00:16:12.240
Cure Beauty!

00:16:14.090 --> 00:16:18.820
Akanbe!

00:16:20.020 --> 00:16:22.130
What can we do? They're trapped!

00:16:22.130 --> 00:16:24.990
If we can make the Akanbe open its mouth wide enough,

00:16:24.990 --> 00:16:27.830
then I believe Happy and Peace can make their escape.

00:16:27.830 --> 00:16:29.920
Alright then, let's do this!

00:16:29.920 --> 00:16:30.690
I'll help too!

00:16:30.690 --> 00:16:31.800
And I!

00:16:40.210 --> 00:16:41.510
Precure...

00:16:44.060 --> 00:16:46.680
Sunny Fire!

00:16:48.690 --> 00:16:50.010
Precure...

00:16:51.650 --> 00:16:55.130
March Shoot!

00:16:55.480 --> 00:16:56.990
Precure...

00:16:59.370 --> 00:17:02.930
Beauty Blizzard!

00:17:08.610 --> 00:17:09.880
Alright!

00:17:09.880 --> 00:17:11.880
Open wide for a sizzling-hot treat!

00:17:13.670 --> 00:17:14.540
Huh?!

00:17:14.540 --> 00:17:16.650
Akanbe!

00:17:16.650 --> 00:17:21.680
It's no good! Our attacks don't work against the blue-nosed Akanbes!

00:17:21.680 --> 00:17:23.350
We need all five of us together!

00:17:23.350 --> 00:17:24.360
Kuru...

00:17:24.360 --> 00:17:25.720
This is bad-kuru!

00:17:26.390 --> 00:17:29.340
Quickly, give them the power of the Butterfly Décor-kuru!

00:17:29.340 --> 00:17:30.920
Huh? What?

00:17:30.920 --> 00:17:32.630
L-Let's give it a try!

00:17:33.910 --> 00:17:36.830
Let's go: Butterfly!

00:17:39.040 --> 00:17:40.230
What?!

00:17:57.080 --> 00:17:58.320
What are these?!

00:17:58.710 --> 00:18:02.060
This is incredible! I never knew the Butterfly Décor could do this!

00:18:04.920 --> 00:18:07.370
We're really flying!

00:18:07.370 --> 00:18:09.420
Butterfly wings...

00:18:09.420 --> 00:18:10.990
Oh right, you hate bugs, don't you March.

00:18:10.990 --> 00:18:15.140
Okay, let's wear out that Akanbe and save the others!

00:18:15.140 --> 00:18:16.810
Okay!

00:18:16.810 --> 00:18:17.940
Akanbe?!

00:18:18.790 --> 00:18:20.700
Come and get us!

00:18:20.700 --> 00:18:22.280
Over here!

00:18:22.910 --> 00:18:24.750
We're over here!

00:18:25.930 --> 00:18:29.790
Akan?!

00:18:28.000 --> 00:18:29.790
Come on, what's wrong?

00:18:31.110 --> 00:18:34.120
Be!

00:18:35.400 --> 00:18:36.960
We're over here!

00:18:36.960 --> 00:18:40.510
Akan!

00:18:40.510 --> 00:18:41.660
Be!

00:18:43.840 --> 00:18:44.900
Akanbe!

00:18:46.420 --> 00:18:48.480
Akanbe...

00:18:48.480 --> 00:18:50.810
We're right here!

00:18:50.810 --> 00:18:52.760
Akan?!

00:18:52.760 --> 00:18:54.500
Come get us!

00:18:52.760 --> 00:18:55.910
Be...

00:18:58.110 --> 00:19:02.770
Nah nah nah nah nah, can't catch me!

00:19:03.870 --> 00:19:06.060
Come on, you can do it!

00:19:06.060 --> 00:19:07.570
Right here!

00:19:07.570 --> 00:19:09.060
Here we are!

00:19:09.060 --> 00:19:12.630
Akanbe...!

00:19:12.630 --> 00:19:14.840
Alright, keep it up...

00:19:16.110 --> 00:19:18.230
Oh, I know! Here, eat this!

00:19:19.630 --> 00:19:22.940
Akanbe...

00:19:22.940 --> 00:19:26.920
Akanbe...!

00:19:28.600 --> 00:19:30.580
Akanbe!

00:19:31.910 --> 00:19:33.750
Akanbe!

00:19:37.150 --> 00:19:38.520
Candy!

00:19:38.520 --> 00:19:39.470
Kuru...

00:19:39.680 --> 00:19:41.910
Thanks, you guys!

00:19:44.000 --> 00:19:45.000
The heck?!

00:19:45.000 --> 00:19:47.260
You smell of pork and soybeans!

00:19:47.260 --> 00:19:48.260
Curse you, Precure!

00:19:48.260 --> 00:19:52.020
Fine then! Time to wreak some havoc on this stupid city-da wasa!

00:19:52.020 --> 00:19:56.510
Akanbe!

00:19:57.910 --> 00:20:01.080
I'm not going to let you ruin this amazing city!

00:20:02.120 --> 00:20:03.060
Come on!

00:20:03.060 --> 00:20:03.950
Right!

00:20:04.440 --> 00:20:10.140
Now, combine your powers-kuru!

00:20:14.920 --> 00:20:16.510
Let's go!

00:20:24.640 --> 00:20:25.910
Precure...

00:20:28.990 --> 00:20:30.910
Rainbow...

00:20:31.350 --> 00:20:33.020
Healing!

00:20:35.830 --> 00:20:38.850
Akanbe...

00:20:44.820 --> 00:20:49.320
Fine, Precure! We'll continue this another day-da wasa!

00:20:55.160 --> 00:20:57.760
What on Earth have I been doing...?

00:21:01.600 --> 00:21:05.330
Thank goodness! Everyone's got their smiles back!

00:21:07.490 --> 00:21:09.280
I'm still starving...

00:21:09.280 --> 00:21:11.650
Oh, right! Reika-chan's still got...

00:21:11.650 --> 00:21:12.920
to try takoyaki!

00:21:14.460 --> 00:21:16.390
I almost forgot!

00:21:19.410 --> 00:21:22.160
I can finally eat!

00:21:22.160 --> 00:21:24.550
On three! One, two!

00:21:24.550 --> 00:21:27.490
Let's eat!

00:21:31.460 --> 00:21:32.970
Hot, hot, hot!

00:21:33.480 --> 00:21:36.280
Well? How's your first takoyaki?

00:21:36.280 --> 00:21:38.230
It's quite delicious!

00:21:39.140 --> 00:21:41.710
It's always better with friends!

00:21:41.710 --> 00:21:44.100
Come on, let's go try those skewers!

00:21:44.100 --> 00:21:45.920
Hey!

00:21:46.750 --> 00:21:49.290
We finally found you!

00:21:50.200 --> 00:21:51.840
You guys tried this takoyaki?

00:21:51.840 --> 00:21:53.820
It's so good!

00:21:56.290 --> 00:22:01.240
And so, our memorable field trip came to an end.

00:22:01.240 --> 00:22:04.010
With ultra happy smiles all around!

00:23:39.440 --> 00:23:40.870
What're you all doing?

00:23:40.870 --> 00:23:42.610
I'm makin' an apron!

00:23:42.610 --> 00:23:44.120
And I'm drawing a picture!

00:23:44.120 --> 00:23:45.140
I'm embroidering!

00:23:45.420 --> 00:23:47.290
I made a teacup!

00:23:47.290 --> 00:23:49.620
That's neat! Are you making presents for someone?

00:23:49.620 --> 00:23:51.180
Well, duh! Our moms!

00:23:51.570 --> 00:23:53.350
It's Mother's Day tomorrow, after all!

00:23:53.350 --> 00:23:54.140
Huh?

00:23:54.520 --> 00:23:56.720
Oh god, I totally forgot!

00:23:57.600 --> 00:23:58.990
Smile Precure:

00:24:01.930 --> 00:24:04.450
Find your ultra happy smile!
